OL,3,GNEWSAMan does a million steps for
OL,4,Aalcohol abuse charity
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has raised #7,000 for a charity
OL,7,Fhe credits with saving his life by
OL,8,Fwalking more than one million steps in
OL,9,Fa month.
OL,11,FDavid Kerr said his drinking had led
OL,12,Fhim to a place he "couldn't see a way
OL,13,Fout of" but Surrey Drug and Alcohol
OL,14,FCare "gave me my life back".
OL,16,FStarting with a 31-mile (50km) race, he
OL,17,Fproceeded to walk the length of the
OL,18,FSouth Downs Way, covering 511 miles in
OL,19,FAugust in aid of the charity.
OL,23,APub: 07-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,328,320,200,140,0,100
