OL,3,GNEWSAMan does a million steps for
OL,4,Aalcohol abuse charity
OL,5,
OL,6,F"I wanted to give something back to
OL,7,Fthem in return, enough that the next
OL,8,Fperson who calls them gets the same
OL,9,Fchance I did," Kerr said.
